{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/19/itm_ae05343f50229804/index.md","canonical_url":"https://safeguards.anthropic.com/2026/self-assessment/","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-19T14:50:06Z","content_hash":"550707b05a2d82a1fb892629c8f6055b01eff822ba453197f89a74fb5857beeb","evidence":[{"label":"Anthropic 原始技术报告","type":"url","url":"https://safeguards.anthropic.com/2026/self-assessment/"},{"label":"Anthropic 使用政策","type":"url","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/legal/aup"},{"label":"Anthropic 2026 年 9 月滥用威胁报告","type":"url","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/threat-intelligence-report-september-2026"}],"external_id":"anthropic-safeguards-self-assessment-2026","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:50:06Z","fingerprint":"550707b05a2d82a1fb892629c8f6055b01eff822ba453197f89a74fb5857beeb","id":"itm_ae05343f50229804","item_id":"itm_ae05343f50229804","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00Z","sort_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00Z","source_id":"anthropic-safeguards","source_name":"Anthropic Safeguards Blog","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"Anthropic 在 2026-10-16 发布 self-assessment：模型在回复后复用 KV cache，以短隐藏反思指令输出固定 JSON 安全评估；通过合成对话 SFT 与六项可验证奖励 RL 蒸馏带完整策略提示的 teacher。在 Claude Fable 5 的生产流量 teacher 标签评测中，1% FPR 下召回 78% 潜在有害对话、94% 高优先级对话，平均约多生成 10 token、估算算力增量低于 2%。四档模型的 1% FPR 召回约从 16% 升至 96%，但去除 fraud/cyber 类训练后的泛化仅证明对模型已理解的类别仍有效。关键局限是 teacher 同时训练和评测、与被监控模型共享盲点，且 24 个攻击任务中把它作为 blocker 只将成功率从 79% 降至 54%，弱于独立 prompted classifier 的 25%，故适合离线监控与人工复核，而非独立实时拦截。","tags":["ai-safety","misuse-detection","self-assessment","monitoring","reinforcement-learning"],"title":"Scaling Misuse Detection with Self-Assessment","title_hash":"afdd58cb160d245bb90eeb6fa08eb9440d75c8680e3da301e4e6a3255c3ec4ec","type":"report","url":"https://safeguards.anthropic.com/2026/self-assessment/"}
